      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果没有能打倒对手的攻击力和自信，\n不接受对战的邀请就是明智之举。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C6CA1670980FD625350125BF9624B7684653B51FB529B548C81EA4FE1FF0C000A4E0D63A553D75BF96218768490808BF75C31662F660E667A4E4B4E3E300200100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你以为能打倒的对手却在下个瞬间回复了，\n请尝尝这种绝望的滋味！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
