      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "压倒性的攻击力！\n充满威胁的耐力！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "538B501260277684653B51FB529BFF01000A51456EE15A0180C176848010529BFF0100100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "光靠回复HP打不赢你。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我很清楚这一点\n并认真选了招式，却还是……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5149976056DE590D0048005062534E0D8D624F60300200100001BE01000A62115F886E05695A8FD94E0070B9000A5E768BA4771F90094E8662DB5F0FFF0C53748FD8662F2026202600100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我承认你很强……\n也承认我太弱。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211627F8BA44F605F885F3A20262026000A4E5F627F8BA46211592A5F31300200100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但我可是\n宝可梦中心的人！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我的绝招是帮宝可梦恢复活力！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46621153EF662F000A5B9D53EF68A64E2D5FC376844EBAFF0100100001BE00000A621176847EDD62DB662F5E2E5B9D53EF68A66062590D6D3B529BFF0100100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以呢，\n我来帮受伤的宝可梦恢复活力吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE55462FF0C000A621167655E2E53D74F2476845B9D53EF68A66062590D6D3B529B5427FF0100100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "帮自己交给自己的宝可梦\n恢复活力感觉有点怪怪的……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E2E81EA5DF14EA47ED981EA5DF176845B9D53EF68A6000A6062590D6D3B529B611F89C9670970B9602A602A76842026202600100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还要跟自己说“交给我的光电伞蜥它们\n全都变得精力充沛了哦！”哈哈。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD889818DDF81EA5DF18BF4201C4EA47ED962117684514975354F1E87255B834EEC000A516890FD53D85F977CBE529B51456C9B4E8654E6FF01201D54C854C8300200100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要你来到这里，\n我都会随时帮你的宝可梦恢复活力哦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
